  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [autodll-webpack-plugin](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin) from `v0.3.6` to `v0.3.9`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v0.3.7`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/releases/0.3.7)\n\n#### Bugfix\n-  Prevented source maps from being injected into html #&#8203;91 @&#8203;WiseBird\n####  Documentation\n- Document **experimental** config option `inherit` #&#8203;92 @&#8203;sudo-suhas\n\n---\n\n### [`v0.3.8`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/releases/0.3.8)\n\n#### Bug fix\n- Fix createMapper with inherit as plain object #&#8203;93 @&#8203;sudo-suhas\n\n---\n\n### [`v0.3.9`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/releases/0.3.9)\n\n#### Bug fix\n- No output file while using [chunkhash] in filename #&#8203;101 @&#8203;CJY0208 \n#### Internal\n- Remove `mkdirp`. #&#8203;96 @&#8203;wtgtybhertgeghgtwtg\n- Replace `merge` utility with spread syntax. #&#8203;97 @&#8203;wtgtybhertgeghgtwtg\n- Replace `concat` utility with spread syntax. #&#8203;98 @&#8203;wtgtybhertgeghgtwtg\n- Replace `keys` utility and `lodash/keys` with `Object.keys`. #&#8203;100 @&#8203;wtgtybhertgeghgtwtg\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v0.3.7\n-   [`d2f3ee3`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/d2f3ee38e5316d12037ca02a85efeeb26069317b) 0.3.6\n-   [`fb45072`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/fb45072b0ed7eb6a9d49bd45d073fd10fe4459ad) Prevented source maps from being injected into html\n-   [`e8642e2`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/e8642e2ac1bdb3787412f4542f7baab103e47f90) Document experimental config option &#x27;inherit&#x27;\n-   [`c4d6238`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/c4d6238640b123782b1018c19468e53f49bbefec) Explicitly extract js and css resources for injection.\n-   [`cda780b`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/cda780b72b4745e96d5a0d11938c6b666ecf18bc) Merge pull request #&#8203;91 from WiseBird/master\n-   [`b63d178`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/b63d1786f865a0e01f80f957b72b6077eb3545d3) Merge pull request #&#8203;92 from asfktz/doc-opt-inherit\n-   [`dcf657f`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/dcf657f69c2e473c8ada97b1fda7ba4f968b8b54) format pkg\n-   [`42f918c`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/42f918c493c9d75b17b3b3de90820f651d6b7f66) 0.3.7\n#### v0.3.8\n-   [`64aed86`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/64aed86b462222c9b7baa74bd4ee2af5a9df8dc8) Fix createMapper with inherit as plain object\n-   [`611b6f2`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/611b6f215163a703a9a91377e813efd718e01e8a) Merge pull request #&#8203;93 from asfktz/fix-createMapper\n-   [`55de7b8`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/55de7b8bec9f491d8ef56cc5591bc5dead6eb07f) 0.3.8\n#### v0.3.9\n-   [`f0a994a`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/f0a994ac8a84746bce2110a1e734b067b65827b7) Purge moment from examples, fixtures\n-   [`ea300a1`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/ea300a164f17e677f40b05aa071f0ff1a12c1878) Merge pull request #&#8203;94 from asfktz/examples-purge-moment\n-   [`800fd59`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/800fd597362904643379f5551527c2af03152069) Cleanup docs (#&#8203;95)\n-   [`f1e37fa`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/f1e37faecd64188398eb266fa89abff61a8cef07) Remove mkdirp, use make-dir instead (#&#8203;96)\n-   [`65bd092`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/65bd092e68493146bee21b9ad9047d8794a93d89) Replace `merge` utility with spread syntax. (#&#8203;97)\n-   [`929aafb`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/929aafbfa1ed2fec8c4e2cd9628250ee49b176c4) Use array spread instead of `concat` utility fn (#&#8203;98)\n-   [`82f6ec0`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/82f6ec036e36a9b353e6b21c17392f6bc2b7b774) Use `Array.isArray` instead of &#x60;lodash/isArray&#x60; (#&#8203;99)\n-   [`f2d4a2c`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/f2d4a2c3b18dc8841fed9d9ba98c02df95101dac) Replace `keys` utility, &#x60;lodash/keys` with `Object.keys&#x60; (#&#8203;100)\n-   [`da42b22`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/da42b2206bffa7a78ac769e4834be0d9e5dfcb7a) Add [chunkhash] support (#&#8203;101)\n-   [`5a72d33`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/5a72d33b2ea37862be95b6e0ca570ba73f5e2000) Merge pull request #&#8203;102 from CJY0208/support-chunkhash\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
